@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<!-- ================= Page hero ================= -->
<section class="svc-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <span class="svc-hero__grid-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="svc-hero__glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div class="container svc-hero__inner">
        <div class="svc-hero__copy">
            <p class="svc-eyebrow svc-eyebrow--light">Legal</p>
            <h1 id="page-title" class="svc-hero__title">
                Privacy <span>Policy</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="svc-hero__lead">
                How NEXUS collects, uses and protects the information you share with us while
                using our website and customer services.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ================= Policy ================= -->
<section class="section policy-body">
    <div class="container">
        <article class="policy-card">
            <p class="policy-updated">Last updated: October 2026</p>

            <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
            <p>When you register, place an order or contact us, we record the details needed to deliver and support your service:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Account details such as your name, email address and phone number.</li>
                <li>Order details such as the selected plan, connection type, installation address and city.</li>
                <li>Service records such as your connection and account number, equipment assigned and connection status.</li>
                <li>Billing and payment records such as bill amounts, tax, payment amounts and payment dates.</li>
                <li>Messages you send through the contact form and feedback you submit on your account.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
            <p>Your information is used only to operate the service you asked for &mdash; processing orders and the feasibility check, scheduling installation, managing your connection, generating bills, recording payments and responding to support requests.</p>

            <h2>3. Where your information is stored</h2>
            <p>Records are stored in the NEXUS service management system. Access is restricted by role: administrators, retail agents, technical staff and accounts staff each see only the information their role requires, and a customer account can only read its own orders, connections, bills, payments and feedback.</p>

            <h2>4. Card and bank details</h2>
            <p>Payment records in this system store the amount, method and date of a payment. Full card numbers and bank credentials are not stored here.</p>

            <h2>5. Sharing</h2>
            <p>We do not sell your personal information. Details are shared only with our own technical, billing and installation teams so they can deliver and support your service.</p>

            <h2>6. Your choices</h2>
            <p>You can review and update your profile from your customer panel, and you can contact us at any time to ask about, correct or request removal of the personal information held against your account.</p>

            <h2>7. Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:support@nexos.local">support&#64;nexos.local</a> or call <a href="tel:+922111122333">+92 21 111 122 333</a>.</p>

            <p class="policy-note">
                This policy describes the current behaviour of the NEXUS service management system.
                Have it reviewed by a legal advisor before it goes live on a public domain.
            </p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
